astralreach.AR_EmptyLargeOxygenCanister.description = Reusable twin-cylinder tank. Fill at an Oxygen Collector on Orbis; 40 minutes normal breathing, 20 minutes underwater. Blueprint: Life Support Survey.
astralreach.AR_LargeOxygenCanister.name = High-Capacity Oxygen Tank · 40 min
astralreach.AR_LargeOxygenCanister.description = Reusable twin-cylinder tank. Fill at an Oxygen Collector on Orbis; 40 minutes normal breathing, 20 minutes underwater. Blueprint: Life Support Survey.
astralreach.AR_LunarRover.name = Lunar Rover
astralreach.AR_LunarRover.description = Secondary action to deploy on clear terrain. Hold a Beacon Cell and use F to load 15 minutes of moving power; holds two cells. Owner drives; a visitor can ride. Use Dismount (F) to exit. Owner crouch-F while empty to pack with its charge.
